<title>USA: Boone, N.C., won by J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Boone, N.C., won by J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford said it won $1.325 million of Boone, N.C., general obligaiton water refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.6402 percent.</p>
</text>
